WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.333
Your logo is not your brand. This is the most misunderstood thing in design.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:14.000
Most people think branding = get a nice logo. Job done.

3
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:24.333
But your logo is one tiny piece of your brand.

4
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:31.000
Your brand includes logo, colors, typography, tone, values, and experience.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Logo = one visual mark. Brand = the full emotional identity.

6
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:47.333
Apple's logo is simple. That's not why people pay a premium.

7
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:52.667
Apple's brand is the reason. The feeling of precision and status.

8
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:59.333
Branding is strategy. A logo is one output of that strategy.

9
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.667
Learn graphic design and branding at 0xverse Academy.

